{"id":740,"gn":"Pokémon Crabe Velu","ft":["Il rêvait d’atteindre le sommet d’un pic enneigé, mais s’est égaré en chemin. Il a dû évoluer pour survivre au froid et a acquis un pelage fourni.","Il distribue les coups de pince au petit bonheur la chance. En dernier recours, il les décroche et les envoie telles des roquettes.","Il concentre le froid dans ses pinces avant de frapper. Ses coups sont suffisamment puissants pour réduire un épais mur de glace en morceaux.","Agir ou réfléchir ? Crabominable choisit de frapper ! On raconte qu’il serait déjà parvenu à repousser une avalanche à coups de pince."],"fv":{"27":0,"28":1,"29":2,"30":3},"gr":4,"cr":60,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Aquatique 3"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"zadlc":[0,88],"svdisk":[0,73],"sv":[0,119],"usum":[0,72],"usum*":[0,72,1,22,2,31,3,25],"sm":[0,60],"sm*":[0,60,1,22,2,31,3,18]},"f":{"740":{"n":"Crabominable","t":["fighting","ice"],"s":[97,132,77,62,67,43],"h":1.7,"w":180,"a":[[52,0],[89,0],[83,1]],"av":["zadlc","svdisk","sv","usum","sm","za"],"hi":[[126,5,[27,28,29,30]]],"ls":[{"l":[[8,0],[43,1],[182,1],[249,1],[61,17],[280,22],[21,25],[419,29],[179,33],[665,37],[334,42],[223,45],[370,49]],"m":[8,9,34,36,58,59,63,89,91,129,133,156,157,164,168,179,182,184,189,196,203,214,240,241,263,264,270,280,282,283,317,334,339,341,370,374,409,411,416,419,428,441,442,523,707,710,776,811,851,861,883,886,912,918]},{"l":[[8,0],[8,1],[145,1],[249,1],[43,1],[228,1],[249,5],[43,9],[228,13],[61,17],[612,22],[146,25],[419,29],[179,33],[665,37],[334,42],[223,45],[370,49]],"m":[58,59,89,92,104,156,157,164,168,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,241,258,263,280,317,339,371,374,411,416,444,496,503,523,524,526,590,693],"t":[8,9,173,196,264,276,283,334,335,409,428,442,530]},{"l":[[8,0],[8,1],[145,1],[249,1],[43,1],[228,1],[249,5],[43,9],[228,13],[61,17],[612,22],[146,25],[419,29],[179,33],[665,37],[334,42],[223,45],[370,49]],"m":[58,59,89,92,104,156,157,164,168,182,207,213,214,216,218,237,240,241,258,263,280,317,339,371,374,411,416,444,496,503,5